    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rgrd](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rgrd) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Oct 12 2025 10km W of Tabogon. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 10.9457 longitude 123.9375. It impacted 572862 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
